{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t《香港01》表示，新聞部收到一封藏有白色粉末的可疑信件。警方表示，下午3時接獲報案，表示公司接獲有可疑粉末的信件，派員到場調查。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n《香港01》說，對於任何企圖利用危險物品、恐嚇信件製造恐慌，意圖阻嚇新聞工作者、干預編採自主的卑劣行徑，予以最嚴厲譴責。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:59:51.384885+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:35:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T14:38:49.196172+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:57:42.920896+00:00","content_hash":"a14bc59b40a1f50b0dc1b24a06797487326863dae64341f3019f137b5c8bf054","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}